teger by a group of integers subtracted", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[251, 869], [1548, 828], [1549, 870], [253, 911]]}, {"text": "together is the same as doing each multiplication separately and then subtracting their", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[252, 926], [1554, 886], [1555, 925], [253, 966]]}, {"text": "products.", "conf": 0.812, "box": [[254, 985], [405, 976], [408, 1014], [256, 1023]]}, {"text": "[(-2) - 1)] × (-3) = [(-3) × (-2)] - [(1) × (-3)]", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[268, 1039], [904, 1019], [906, 1058], [269, 1078]]}, {"text": "Here \"-3\" can be \"distributed\" across the \"(-2)-1\" as below.", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[260, 1093], [1153, 1067], [1154, 1106], [261, 1132]]}, {"text": "[(-2) - 1)] × (-3) = [(-3) × (-2)] - [(1) × (-3)]", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[264, 1151], [900, 1133], [901, 1172], [265, 1190]]}, {"text": "Look below:", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[265, 1207], [455, 1200], [456, 1237], [267, 1243]]}, {"text": "Right Hand Side (R.H.S)", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[801, 1272], [1140, 1267], [1141, 1307], [801, 1312]]}, {"text": "Left Hand Side (L.H.S)", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[270, 1286], [598, 1277], [599, 1313], [271, 1322]]}, {"text": "[(-3) × (-2)] -[(1) × (-3)]", "conf": 0.871, "box": [[803, 1330], [1156, 1326], [1157, 1363], [803, 1367]]}, {"text": "[(-2) = 1)] × (-3)", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[273, 1345], [517, 1335], [519, 1372], [275, 1382]]}, {"text": "= +6 - (-3)", "conf": 0.823, "box": [[806, 1386], [970, 1386], [970, 1423], [806, 1423]]}, {"text": "= -3 × (-3)", "conf": 0.8, "box": [[275, 1398], [448, 1394], [448, 1432], [276, 1436]]}, {"text": "=+9", "conf": 0.747, "box": [[805, 1439], [886, 1439], [886, 1477], [805, 1477]]}, {"text": "6+ =", "conf": 0.69, "box": [[277, 1452], [363, 1452], [363, 1490], [277, 1490]]}, {"text": "We observe that L.H.S = R.H.S", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[282, 1553], [734, 1538], [735, 1574], [283, 1589]]}, {"text": "Thus, [(-2) - 1)] × (-3) = [(-3) × (-2)] - [(1) × (-3)]", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[283, 1601], [1012, 1590